        {
          "question": "Were the appellants and co-defendants jointly and severally liable for $825,079.30 and equally responsible as between themselves?",
          "answers": [
            {
              "answer": "No. Their liability was several because the parties had distinct causes of action and had not acted in concert; the appellants' liability was secondary, so after making the respondent whole they were entitled to an assignment of the respondent's judgment against the co-defendants.",
